# Formula 1 Circuits: SQL Analysis in PostgreSQL

A portfolio project that explores a dataset of 77 Formula 1 circuits using PostgreSQL. It answers ten analytical questions that move from simple filtering and aggregation to window functions, CTEs, string functions, and a geographic distance calculation (the haversine formula) built entirely in SQL.

Every question below follows the same pattern: the question in plain English, the approach, the query, the result, and what the result means.

